.TH VIBECODER 1 "November 2026" "vibecoder 0.0.1"
.SH NAME
vibecoder \- administer the local vibecoder daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vibecoder
.I command
.SH DESCRIPTION
Configures GitHub, isolated workers and projects through the protected Unix socket.
.SH QUICK START
Run "vibecoder github login", "vibecoder worker add codex", "vibecoder worker codex-1 login", then from a Git repository run "vibecoder project add".
.SH SECURITY
Mutations require root or membership in vibecoder-admin. Workers never receive the GitHub PAT and pull request merges remain human-only.
